.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH HOPASH-RULE-REPLACE 1 2026-08-01 "Hopash RS 0.1.0" "Hopash RS User Commands"
.SH NAME
hopash\-rule\-replace \- Replace one exact, complete Rule String
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhopash rule replace\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOLD_RULE\fR> <\fINEW_RULE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace one exact, complete Rule String
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIOLD_RULE\fR>
Exact, complete Rule String to replace
.TP
<\fINEW_RULE\fR>
Complete Rule String to insert in its place
